// Filesystem-backed store for VispNote vaults.
// Layout:
//   <root>/.config.json                  global config (vaults list, active vault, tweaks)
//   <root>/<slug>/.meta.json             per-vault metadata (name, tags w/ hues, lastSelectedId)
